<title>USA: Cosmetic Center sales rise in August.</title>
<headline>Cosmetic Center sales rise in August.</headline>
<dateline>SAVAGE, Md. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cosmetic Center Inc said on Wednesday that its sales for the month ended August 30, 1996 increased three percent to $11.7 million from $11.4 million in the year ago period.</p>
</text>
